.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH wpaperd 1  "wpaperd 1.3.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
wpaperd \- A wallpaper manager for Wayland compositors
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBwpaperd\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-daemon\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-notify\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A wallpaper manager for Wayland compositors
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to the configuration (XDG_CONFIG_HOME/wpaperd/config.toml by default)
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-daemon\fR
Detach from the current terminal and run in the background
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase the verbosity of wpaperd
.TP
\fB\-\-notify\fR \fI<NOTIFY>\fR
Readiness fd used by wpaperd to signal that it has started correctly
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v1.3.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Danilo Spinella <danilo.spinella@suse.com>
